WEBVTT

01:05:01.180 --> 01:05:02.931
Countdown will commence
momentarily.

01:05:03.015 --> 01:05:05.267
-Stand by.
-Let's go.

01:05:05.351 --> 01:05:09.604
Hey, Ma! Where are the matches?
Oh, wait. Here they are. Never mind.

01:05:09.689 --> 01:05:12.148
Woody! Great!
Help me outta this thing.

01:05:12.692 --> 01:05:16.111
-What?
-It's okay. Everything's under control.

01:05:17.697 --> 01:05:18.863
Woody, what are you doing?

01:05:18.948 --> 01:05:23.201
Houston. All systems are go.
Requesting permission to launch...

01:05:24.161 --> 01:05:26.580
Hey? How'd you get out here?

01:05:28.249 --> 01:05:31.293
Oh, well. You and I
can have a cookout later.
